        {"type":"mol","smiles":"O=[N+]([O-])c1ccc2c(c1)CCC1(CCC1)O2"}
     ]
   }
 ]
}

Now the other precursor of reaction 1914397 (the protected amine) "CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCNCC1" has no further children.

